    "final_answer": "I now have all the information needed. Let me provide the final answer.\n\n## Final Answer\n\n**Current #1 Artist on Spotify Global Top 50:** **KAROL G**\n\nKarol G currently sits at #1 on the Spotify Global Top 50 with the song **\"BbY WOW\"** (a collaboration with Judeline and rusowsky), which has been at #1 for 29 consecutive days and is currently streaming ~5.9 million times per day.\n\n**KAROL G's Top 10 Songs (ranked by total Spotify streams):**\n\n| # | Song Title | Total Streams | Daily Streams |\n|---|------------|---------------|---------------|\n| 1 | Si Antes Te Hubiera Conocido | 1,931,646,353 | 1,380,243 |\n| 2 | PROVENZA | 1,808,199,367 | 642,207 |\n| 3 | Tusa | 1,754,677,754 | 396,398 |\n| 4 | TQG | 1,558,085,273 | 573,881 |\n| 5 | QLONA (with Peso Pluma) | 1,492,463,414 | 542,780 |\n| 6 | China (as feature) | 1,444,961,609 | 576,135 |\n| 7 | AMARGURA | 1,266,283,677 | 567,058 |\n| 8 | MAMIII (as feature) | 1,259,470,738 | 438,520 |\n| 9 | BICHOTA | 1,006,324,784 | 124,581 |\n| 10 | Secreto (as feature) | 935,253,914 | 306,797 |\n\n**Source:** The Spotify Global Top 50 playlist (https://open.spotify.com/playlist/37i9dQZEVXbNG2KDcFcKOF) shows KAROL G at the top as of the chart dated 2026/09/25. Her artist-specific song rankings were verified via kworb.net's Spotify artist data (https://kworb.net/spotify/artist/790FomKkXshlbRYZFtlgla_songs.html).\n\nNote: The songs marked \"as feature\" are collaborations where Karol G is featured as an artist rather than the lead.",
